#: ../../guide/syntax-reference.md:377
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The alethic (`Box`, `Diamond`), epistemic/doxastic (`Knows`, `Believes`), "
"assertive/bouletic (`Says`, `Wants` — agent-prefix attitude operators "
"`Say_a` / `Want_a`; see {doc}`natural-language`), and deontic (`Obligatory`,"
" `Permitted`) nodes round out the modal family; see the modal-logic page. "
"All modal nodes reject `to_z3` / `to_prover9` / `to_tptp` directly — "
"translate first with `standard_translation()`."
msgstr ""
"Die alethischen (`Box`, `Diamond`), epistemischen/doxastischen (`Knows`, "
"`Believes`), assertiven/bouletischen (`Says`, `Wants` — "
"Einstellungsoperatoren mit Agens-Präfix `Say_a` / `Want_a`; siehe "
"{doc}`natural-language`) und deontischen (`Obligatory`, `Permitted`) Knoten "
"runden die modale Familie ab; siehe die Seite zur Modallogik. Alle modalen "
"Knoten weisen `to_z3` / `to_prover9` / `to_tptp` direkt zurück — zunächst "
"mit `standard_translation()` übersetzen."

